==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*7 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Dagshund]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Kill the Celeboodle with [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]], as well as a few small meatshields like [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Mohawk Cat]], so you can afford [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. Once the Angelic Gory spawns, send out Bahamut to snipe him and instantly eliminate most of the starting peons. They should all supply you with ample cash, enough to cover [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] and King Dragon Cat stacking expenditures, letting you breeze by the rest of the stage.

